I go into the bedroom.
This bedroom is small and nice.
There is a wooden wardrobe in the room.
The wardrobe is near the wall.
There is a big bed near the window.
I open my big suitcase.
My clothes are in the suitcase.
I take out my shirts first.
I keep those shirts in the wardrobe.
I put some clothes on the bed.
Then I keep those clothes in the wardrobe too.
Now my suitcase is empty.
I close the suitcase.
I put the empty suitcase under the bed.
The suitcase is now kept under the bed.
All my clothes are now in the wardrobe.
My room looks very nice now.
